  "description": "Dirty Western is a rugged vintage display font featuring distressed textures and bold slab-serif characters inspired by the American Wild West. This font captures the authentic feel of old saloon signage, cowboy posters, whiskey labels, and rustic branding. Perfect for western-themed projects, vintage logos, apparel designs, packaging, posters, invitations, and retro merchandise.\nIts weathered texture and bold personality make it ideal for creating eye-catching designs with a classic frontier atmosphere.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Dirty Western is a rugged vintage display font featuring distressed textures and bold slab-serif characters inspired by the American Wild West. This font captures the authentic feel of old saloon signage, cowboy posters, whiskey labels, and rustic branding. Perfect for western-themed projects, vintage logos, apparel designs, packaging, posters, invitations, and retro merchandise.</p>\n<p>Its weathered texture and bold personality make it ideal for creating eye-catching designs with a classic frontier atmosphere.</p>",
